00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:55.920
So, right now in
Johnson, if you're

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.290
wondering what's happening
to your children,

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:01.560
or your loved one,
they're actually robing.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.510
And they're getting
in line, and they

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.960
have to stay in their
exact place in line,

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.990
because they're going to
receive their actual diploma.

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.620
MIT does this very differently
from other schools.

00:20:12.620 --> 00:20:15.300
At other schools, you just go
up and get some empty case.

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.960
At here, you get
the actual diploma.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.050
So they have to get in
line and stay in line,

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:22.800
and this is why this
is a big production.

