00:22:23.413 --> 00:22:25.010
that you've spent at MIT.

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:26.394
CHEMI: One memorable moment.

00:22:26.394 --> 00:22:28.907
CHEMI: My swim test
barely making it

00:22:28.907 --> 00:22:33.190
on the last lap the day before
the first day of classes.

00:22:33.190 --> 00:22:35.980
I almost didn't make
it, but I got there.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:36.730
JONES: So tell me.

00:22:36.730 --> 00:22:37.652
What is the swim test?

00:22:37.652 --> 00:22:39.860
A lot of people here don't
even know what that means.

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:42.786
