00:31:18.720 --> 00:31:20.190
that I wouldn't
have met otherwise

00:31:20.190 --> 00:31:21.680
who I would see afterwards.

00:31:21.680 --> 00:31:23.400
And I was like, ah,
you're on my IM team.

00:31:23.400 --> 00:31:24.150
So how's it going?

00:31:24.150 --> 00:31:25.380
How's your research?

00:31:25.380 --> 00:31:26.929
- They don't exist
for themselves.

00:31:26.929 --> 00:31:29.470
They don't exist for the alumni
