00:33:41.030 --> 00:33:43.790
Currently, about
20% of the students

00:33:43.790 --> 00:33:47.600
are involved in a varsity
sport; about 80% of the students

00:33:47.600 --> 00:33:50.390
are involved in
intramural sports;

00:33:50.390 --> 00:33:53.240
and 100% of the
undergraduates are

00:33:53.240 --> 00:33:55.430
involved in the physical
education program.

00:33:55.430 --> 00:33:58.440
- So it really lets students
pursue their interests,

00:33:58.440 --> 00:34:01.231
whether they pursue them as
an extracurricular activity

00:34:01.231 --> 00:34:03.230
through their school
previously, or whether it's

00:34:03.230 --> 00:34:06.120
something brand new.

00:34:06.120 --> 00:34:09.260
- We've been able to make
major investments in facilities

00:34:09.260 --> 00:34:12.199
and support services
that have enhanced

00:34:12.199 --> 00:34:13.530
an already vital program.

00:34:22.383 --> 00:34:24.924
The biggest single change has
been the opening of the Zesiger

00:34:24.924 --> 00:34:25.424
Center.

00:34:25.424 --> 00:34:27.344
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:34:35.090 --> 00:34:35.980
- The Z Center--

00:34:35.980 --> 00:34:37.639
that thing is just beautiful.

00:34:37.639 --> 00:34:39.940
- It just seemed like the
MIT campus became healthier,

